{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the dark cemetery, restless spirits wander endlessly. As a ghost hunter, you must survive under Death\u2019s watchful gaze and purge the phantoms lurking in the shadows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Diverse Arsenal</i></strong> \u2013 Equip pistols, machine guns, and combat knives, choosing the most effective method to eliminate them based on the situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phosphor Grenades</strong> \u2013 Illuminate the graveyard, dealing massive damage to ghosts. Use them wisely to turn the tide in desperate moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stealth Mode</strong> \u2013 Ghosts will struggle to detect you. Sneak close to gain the advantage of a first strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Ammo Resupply</strong> \u2013 Ammo drop locations change with each wave. Search carefully during combat and manage your ammunition wisely.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761500?t=1748320692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761500?t=1748320692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761500/0c1bcddffcc59b2281a4e3222373484cc53ecdb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748320692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761500/0c1bcddffcc59b2281a4e3222373484cc53ecdb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748320692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the dark cemetery, restless spirits wander endlessly. As a ghost hunter, you must survive under Death\u2019s watchful gaze and purge the phantoms lurking in the shadows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul